  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z7
  Title: Resizing outlines and Outlines count
  Summary: A resizing step is drawn as outlines at several moments, fading in from
    first to last.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 213629268}
  HowTo: Expand Grow. Open Scene Gizmos (under the preview buttons) and move Outlines
    from 2 to 12.
  Expect: Grow's outlines fade in towards the end, and OutBack's overshoot shows
    as an outline bigger than the last. The number of outlines follows the setting.
    With an Out ease the last moments bunch up near the end, and no outline is drawn
    within a few points of an end.
