  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Each box grows around its pivot (centre), so dragging the
    right edge moves the left one too. Shift on a corner keeps the box's shape; on
    an edge the other side grows with it. Played back, each lands on the dropped
    outline. Modes are kept; Current Snapped rounds on release.
