  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z8
  Title: 'Scene Gizmos: Show and Colors'
  Summary: Four animations from one dot. The Scene Gizmos settings choose what's
    drawn and how it's coloured.
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 428822259}
  HowTo: 'Collapse all four. Open Scene Gizmos and try each Show: Disabled, All Animations,
    Expanded Animations, Expanded Steps, Selected Step. Expand Loop and some of its
    steps. Try Colors: Distinct, Shuffle Colors, Rainbow.'
  Expect: All draws all four from rest even collapsed; Expanded Animations only the
    expanded ones; Expanded Steps only open steps; Disabled nothing. Distinct gives
    each a clearly different colour and Shuffle changes them. Rainbow colours red
    to purple by step, and only applies with Expanded Steps.
  Needs: 12
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
