  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z5
  Title: Scale handles
  Summary: 'Scale outlines have handles too: a pop-in from scale 0, a tilted box,
    and one with scale Z 3.'
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 608535549}
  HowTo: Expand all three. Drag Pop In's From rings out of the point they start as.
    Drag Tilted Grow's edges. Drag Z Kept's corner and read its To.
  Expect: Pop In's From grows outwards in whichever direction you pull (never a negative
    scale). The tilted outline's handles follow its tilt. Z Kept's Z stays 3 whatever
    you drag.
  Needs: 13
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
