  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> While editing, the move tool is hidden and clicking empty
    space does nothing (nothing deselects). + adds a point there; Ctrl+click turns
    a point red and removes it. Every drag is one Undo step. Esc (or Done) stops
    editing and the move tool comes back. The line is solid (To is Absolute).
