  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z9
  Title: The selected step
  Summary: Five scale steps whose outlines overlap, and a sixth that goes nowhere
    (Still, scaled to the size it already is).
  Watch: this tile's player
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 690109757}
  HowTo: Expand Crowd. Click on step 3's header, then on a field of step 4, then
    on the drag-handle margin of step 6. Set Show to Selected Step, then back.
  Expect: The last-clicked step gets a blue bar down its left in the Inspector, and
    in the Scene view is drawn on top with a dark halo, even step 6 which goes nowhere.
    Selected Step draws it alone. Collapsing the animation still draws the selected
    step.
