  m_text: '<b>Expect:</b> Absolute: solid. Current: dotted. Baseline: step 1 dashed,
    with a faint cross at the Baseline dot''s rest and a faint dashed line from there
    to the end. Box From To: first outline dashed (From Baseline) with a faint dashed
    ghost of the box at rest, last outline solid (To Absolute), the outlines between
    solid.'
