  Code: Z11
  Title: A path drawn from where it really starts
  Summary: Step 1 is a path with no From. It starts where step 0's dip leaves the
    ball, and must be drawn from there.
  Watch: this tile's player, Ball
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 985186175}
  - {fileID: 1973757248}
  HowTo: Press Edit Path in Scene on step 1, then Play the animation.
  Expect: The path starts at the bottom of the dip, not at the ball's resting place,
    and it stays put while the preview moves the ball.
