  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: Z10
  Title: Edit Path in Scene
  Summary: A path's middle points are edited in the Scene view, like Unity's Edit
    Collider.
  Watch: this tile's player, Ball
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1035316110}
  - {fileID: 603045776}
  HowTo: Open Swoop's step and press <b>Edit Path in Scene</b>. Drag the numbered
    points, From/To, click a small + on the line, Ctrl+click a point, click empty
    space, press Esc. Undo the drags.
  Expect: While editing, the move tool is hidden and clicking empty space does nothing
    (nothing deselects). + adds a point there; Ctrl+click turns a point red and removes
    it. Every drag is one Undo step. Esc (or Done) stops editing and the move tool
    comes back. The line is solid (To is Absolute).
  Needs: 13
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
  Header: {fileID: 48267039}
  Stage: {fileID: 988852229}
  Footer: {fileID: 1556983858}
